  "notes": "## 0.13.0-alpha.5 - 2026-05-31\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make the launch-at-login setting actually register with the operating system and keep it aligned after app updates or moved installs (#925)\n- Bring the macOS update window to the front even when the app is running from the menu bar with the main window hidden (#926)\n- Show separate Windows x64 and ARM64 installer and portable downloads with the correct labels in release notes (#924)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.13.0-alpha.5 - 2026-05-31\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复“登录时启动”设置未真正注册到操作系统的问题，并在应用更新或安装位置变化后保持一致 (#925)\n- 修复 macOS 上应用主窗口隐藏在菜单栏时，更新窗口不会自动出现在最前方的问题 (#926)\n- 修复发布说明中 Windows x64 与 ARM64 安装包、便携版下载项未分别显示且标签可能错误的问题 (#924)",
